S0.2  one-paragraph definition:
Nailed It is a premium consumer nail-design studio that lets a user discover nail inspiration, create highly detailed nail designs themselves using a professional but approachable layer-based editor, save and revisit those designs, and realistically preview them on their own hand using AR. The core experience must feel like a genuinely polished consumer design product rather than an MVP: photorealistic nail materials, sophisticated colour/texture/lighting, fluid gestures and motion, eight powerful editing studios, a beautiful curated inspiration catalogue, and AR that convincingly anchors the design to the physical nail instead of appearing as a flat floating sticker. The defining features of the product are the nail editor, visual/design quality, and convincing AR try-on.

